# Close soft-preserved / HLS-origin sessions for other channels on Activate (zap).
# After #807 soft-preserve, flipping channels left adaptive/HLS/Catchup sessions and
# hls-cache origin bindings until TTL. This terminates other virtual_ids for the same
# username+client (IP/fingerprint), clears provider + hls-cache reservations, and
# hard-removes Streams panel rows (DisconnectedStream / Disconnected).
# Apply BEFORE user-hide-adult.patch.

